#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:86
#: 63b87d94f3014126966e16665be2348f
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:88
#: 1457eb8d960c4244a3fce39b997172c8
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6, 7/8, 9 , and 10."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但 DShot 与普通 PWM 混用受组限制，即为某组中的输出启用 DShot "
"后，该组所有输出均需配置并用作 DShot 而非 PWM 输出。必须相同（相同 PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，当配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/2、3/4、5/6、7/8、9 和 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:91
#: f4133dc0302c4c15bb058c80752a8070
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:93
#: 43ddefe9ac5a415d99f6928cf42d57cf
msgid ""
"The first 8 servo/motor outputs are marked on the board: M1,M2,S3-S8 . S9 is"
" a solder pad on the board, and S10 is connected to the pin marked LED in "
"ArduPilot's definition. Using S10 allows the easy grouping for odd numbers "
"of motors with a common DShot or PWM frequency without sacrificing the use "
"of an output for servo use due to rate issues (see above Dshot discussion)."
msgstr ""
"前 8 路舵机/电机输出在板上标注为：M1、M2、S3-S8。S9 是板上的焊盘，S10 在 ArduPilot 定义中连接到标有 LED 的引脚。使用"
" S10 可方便地将奇数数量的电机分组，使用统一的 DShot 或 PWM 频率，而不必因频率问题牺牲一路舵机输出（参见上述 DShot 讨论）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:97
#: 9e5366e57ce94e5193f96a35aae2ce87
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:99
#: 5687f3dbc23d4654a10abb19b37e6722
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to R2 (UART2 RX), which by default is"
" mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚通过反相器传递到 R2（UART2 RX），默认映射到定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这些协议需要真实 UART 连接）。不过，FPort 以此方式连接时只能提供 RC 功能（无数传）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:101
#: cc40b16091574ab3820d55b28c940397
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the R2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX pin"
" for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"为使用 FPort、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和内嵌数传功能，R2 引脚也可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为「1」来配置为真实 UART2 RX 引脚，供双向系统使用，成为 "
"SERIAL7 接口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:103
#: 87bd52d8e19243d4ac5383391264fe4b
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:105
#: b9b9433c9ae4477f90378e0cf5287c1f
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:107
#: 8dbbb44fd4884e74a364be964b411e67
msgid ""
"DSM/SRXL connects to the R2  pin, but SBUS would still be connected to SBUS."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL 连接到 R2 引脚，但 SBUS 仍连接到 SBUS 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:109
#: 364e6412ab7849a79eb8458c8d74982c
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and R2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向反相器连接到 T2 和 R2。参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:111
#: 67be7d4c13f24746be8956eeb64604c1
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 R2 外还需要 T2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:113
#: 471ea5595b234ed38fd39d09584f7728
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 T2 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:115
#: 347c85363d2a445a9da5b91d5385de44
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容（SBUS 在其他 UART 上需外部反相）。详情见"
" :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

