#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:143
#: 3bc8261b3cf14737ae35ee8a3079829d
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:145
#: 655ec59d29a14fbf9ef99b73258fa372
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected for "
"autonomous modes to function. Compass is not required for normal Plane mode "
"operation, but is for typical Copter, QuadPlane, and Rover operation."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不含 GPS 或罗盘，需连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。普通 Plane 模式无需罗盘，但 Copter、QuadPlane 和 Rover 的典型操作需要罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:148
